triage: fix_game: All four tide-end scenarios crash inside the game file with CalcError 'you.hand[0]': list index out of range. The file reads the first card of a hand without checking that the hand still has a card, most likely in the forced fifth-round pick or the tableau move at tide end. A crash in the file's own arithmetic is an implementation defect, not a flaw in the rules or a platform gap.
